      "fine_trace_step": 1,
      "description": "The compiler materializes the oversized attacker-controlled decimal token into an `IREP_TT_BIGINT` pool entry, preserving the exact digit bytes and bigint base metadata that runtime later uses to instantiate the live `mpz_t` value."
