      "verified": true,
      "verified_by": "required.second_limb_probe_requires_two_digits",
      "fine_trace_step": 11,
      "description": "The original guard conflates 'has more than two digits' with 'may inspect the second limb'. When `digits(y) == 1`, the first disjunct is false but the code still evaluates `y->p[1] > 1`. The patch fixes this exact missing obligation by caching `d = digits(y)` and only touching `y->p[1]` when `d == 2`."
    },
